{"4995500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pawcel: Bounce", "steam_appid": 4995500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5065750], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A package was delivered to your house by mistake. The address on the package is in another country, so you set out to return it in person, well, in dog (you are a dog).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4995500/extras/e11a49e33e73edde6775424bb802bc55.avif?t=1787803971\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4995500/extras_big/e11a49e33e73edde6775424bb802bc55.webp?t=1787803971 width=1560 height=717 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The country turns out to be a strange place. People (dogs) there settle everything with target-shooting duels. Nobody finds this odd except you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4995500/extras/0d7e6573e6f3283d799633e9f1bd17bc.avif?t=1787803971\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4995500/extras_big/0d7e6573e6f3283d799633e9f1bd17bc.webp?t=1787803971 width=1560 height=890 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trick is the ricochet: bullets bounce off walls, so the best shots are the ones that look impossible until they land. Hitting targets shakes your opponent's confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4995500/extras/f243f0791d19cd46b88aebaec5922dc4.poster.avif?t=1787803971\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4995500/extras/f243f0791d19cd46b88aebaec5922dc4.webm?t=1787803971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4995500/extras/f243f0791d19cd46b88aebaec5922dc4.mp4?t=1787803971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way you travel with a cat who was raised by dogs and firmly believes she is one. You meet the locals, run into trouble, help random grandma, and sort most of it out with a well-placed bank shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4995500/extras/505663235ea4253c40b955848c5ec7b8.avif?t=1787803971\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4995500/extras_big/505663235ea4253c40b955848c5ec7b8.webp?t=1787803971 width=1560 height=890 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very fun story </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet random dogs (well, mostly) along the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can shoot random objects along the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pretty scene</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting levels</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A package was delivered to your house by mistake. The address on the package is in another country, so you set out to return it in person, well, in dog (you are a dog).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4995500/extras/e11a49e33e73edde6775424bb802bc55.avif?t=1787803971\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4995500/extras_big/e11a49e33e73edde6775424bb802bc55.webp?t=1787803971 width=1560 height=7